---
import styleCss from '../../public/style.css?raw';
interface Props {
  title: string;
  description: string;
  image: string;
  imageAlt?: string;
  jsonLd?: Record<string, unknown> | Record<string, unknown>[];
}
const { title, description, image, imageAlt, jsonLd } = Astro.props;
// public/style.css 는 해시 없는 고정 주소라 Cloudflare(4시간 캐시)가 배포 뒤에도 예전 파일을 내보낸다(2026-10-14 v2 배포 사고).
// 내용 해시(FNV-1a)를 쿼리로 붙여, CSS가 바뀌면 주소도 바뀌게 한다(Node 타입 없이 빌드되도록 ?raw 로 읽음).
let h = 0x811c9dc5;
for (let i = 0; i < styleCss.length; i++) h = Math.imul(h ^ styleCss.charCodeAt(i), 0x01000193);
const cssVer = (h >>> 0).toString(16).padStart(8, '0');
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const prefix = base.endsWith('/') ? base : `${base}/`;
const path = Astro.url.pathname;
const docTitle = title.includes('열린도구') ? title : `${title} — 열린도구`;
const origin = Astro.site ?? new URL('https://edtechnewsroom.com');
const canonical = new URL(Astro.url.pathname, origin).href;
const ogImage = new URL(`${prefix}og/${image}`, origin).href;
const feedHref = new URL(`${prefix}feed.xml`, origin).href;
const googleVerify = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_GOOGLE_SITE_VERIFICATION;
const naverVerify = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_NAVER_SITE_VERIFICATION;
const daumVerify = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_DAUM_SITE_VERIFICATION;
const ldBlocks = jsonLd ? (Array.isArray(jsonLd) ? jsonLd : [jsonLd]) : [];
const json = (data: Record<string, unknown>) => JSON.stringify(data).replace(/</g, '\\u003c');
const fontHref = 'https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Sans+KR:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap';
const navLinks = [
  { href: base, label: '대안 찾기', match: `${base}apps/` },
  { href: `${base}skills/`, label: '오픈스킬', match: `${base}skills/` },
  { href: `${base}about/`, label: '소개', match: `${base}about/` },
];
---
<html lang="ko"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>{docTitle}</title>
<meta name="description" content={description}>
<link rel="canonical" href={canonical}>
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta property="og:locale" content="ko_KR">
<meta property="og:site_name" content="열린도구">
<meta property="og:title" content={docTitle}>
<meta property="og:description" content={description}>
<meta property="og:url" content={canonical}>
<meta property="og:image" content={ogImage}>
<meta property="og:image:alt" content={imageAlt || title}>
<meta property="og:image:width" content="1200">
<meta property="og:image:height" content="630">
<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
<meta name="twitter:title" content={docTitle}>
<meta name="twitter:description" content={description}>
<meta name="twitter:image" content={ogImage}>
<link rel="alternate" type="application/rss+xml" title="열린도구 변경" href={feedHref}>
{googleVerify && <meta name="google-site-verification" content={googleVerify}>}
{naverVerify && <meta name="naver-site-verification" content={naverVerify}>}
{daumVerify && <meta name="daum-site-verification" content={daumVerify}>}
{ldBlocks.map((block) => <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={json(block)} />)}
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="preload" as="style" href={fontHref} onload="this.onload=null;this.rel='stylesheet'">
<noscript><link rel="stylesheet" href={fontHref}></noscript>
<link rel="stylesheet" href={`${base}style.css?v=${cssVer}`}></head>
<body>
<a class="skip" href="#main">본문으로 건너뛰기</a>
<header class="top ux">
  <div class="wrap">
    <a class="logo" href={base}>
      <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 28 28" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="6" width="24" height="18" rx="4" fill="none" stroke="#1E6A47" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M9 6V4h10v2" fill="none" stroke="#1E6A47" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M2 13h24" stroke="#1E6A47" stroke-width="2"/></svg>
      <b>열린도구</b><span>Alternatives</span>
    </a>
    <nav class="main desktop" aria-label="주 메뉴">
      {navLinks.map((link) => (
        <a href={link.href} aria-current={path.startsWith(link.match) ? 'page' : undefined}>{link.label}</a>
      ))}
    </nav>
    <a class="btn soft desktop" href={`${base}#news`}>뉴스레터(준비 중)</a>
    <button class="u045-ham mobile" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="메뉴 열기"><i></i><i></i><i></i></button>
  </div>
  <div class="u045-sheet" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="전체 메뉴" aria-hidden="true">
    <small>메뉴</small>
    <ul class="u045-nav">
      {navLinks.map((link, i) => (
        <li><a class="u045-ln" href={link.href} style={`--i:${i}`} aria-current={path.startsWith(link.match) ? 'page' : undefined}><span>{link.label}</span></a></li>
      ))}
    </ul>
    <div class="u045-foot"><a href={`${base}#news`}>뉴스레터(준비 중)</a></div>
  </div>
</header>
<main id="main"><slot /></main>
<footer><div class="wrap">
  <div class="foot-cols">
    <section>
      <b>열린도구</b>
      <p>학교에서 이미 쓰는 유료·상용 앱 대신 쓸 수 있는 오픈소스 대안, 그리고 수업·업무에 쓸 수 있는 AI 에이전트 스킬을 정리합니다.</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <b>콘텐츠</b>
      <ul>
        <li><a href={base}>대안 찾기 (오픈소스 대안)</a></li>
        <li><a href={`${base}skills/`}>오픈스킬</a></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="foot-note">현장사례·수업지도안·심층리뷰는 정식 콘텐츠가 모이면 공개됩니다. 현재 운영은 위 2개 축만 제공합니다.</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <b>함께</b>
      <ul>
        <li><a href={`${base}about/`}>사이트 소개</a></li>
        <li><a href={`${base}suggest/`}>대안·정정 제안</a></li>
        <li><a href={`${base}compare/`}>모든 도구 비교</a></li>
        <li><a href={`${base}changes/`}>변경 이력</a></li>
        <li><a href={feedHref}>변경 피드</a></li>
        <li><a href={`${base}#news`}>뉴스레터(준비 중)</a></li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </div>
  <div class="foot-meta">
    <span>각 프로젝트의 공개 자료로 정리한 정보입니다. 학교 적합성이나 법적 요건 충족 여부는 판정하지 않습니다.</span>
    <span>구매 학교 수 출처: school-edtech.kr (2026년 1~10월, 확인 중)</span>
    <span>운영: AI 에이전트가 매일 GitHub/GitLab API로 재확인 · <a href={`${base}about/`}>운영 원칙</a> · <a href="https://github.com/scottnaddle/open-tools-alternatives" target="_blank" rel="noopener">소스</a></span>
  </div>
</div></footer>
<style>
/* Lucian UX/UI Prompt #045 hamburger menu styles */
.mobile{display:none}
@media (max-width:768px){
  .desktop{display:none!important}
  .mobile{display:flex}
  header.top .wrap{position:relative;z-index:100}
}
.u045-ham{position:relative;width:46px;height:46px;border:0;padding:0;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ux-surface-2);color:var(--ux-ink);transition:transform .4s var(--ux-spring),background-color .4s}
header.top.is-open .u045-ham{background:var(--line-2);color:var(--ink)}
.u045-ham:hover{transform:scale(1.06)}
.u045-ham:active{transform:scale(.9)}
.u045-ham:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ux-accent);outline-offset:3px}
.u045-ham i{position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;width:18px;height:2px;margin:-1px 0 0 -9px;border-radius:2px;background:currentColor;transition:transform .55s var(--ux-spring),opacity .25s,width .4s var(--ux-ease)}
.u045-ham i:nth-child(1){transform:translateY(-6px)}
.u045-ham i:nth-child(2){width:12px;margin-left:-3px}
.u045-ham i:nth-child(3){transform:translateY(6px)}
header.top.is-open .u045-ham i:nth-child(1){transform:rotate(45deg)}
header.top.is-open .u045-ham i:nth-child(2){opacity:0;transform:translateX(8px)}
header.top.is-open .u045-ham i:nth-child(3){transform:rotate(-45deg)}
.u045-sheet{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:90;padding:96px 26px 26px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink);clip-path:circle(0 at var(--cx,300px) var(--cy,34px));visibility:hidden;transition:clip-path .7s var(--ux-ease),visibility 0s .7s}
header.top.is-open .u045-sheet{clip-path:circle(1200px at var(--cx,300px) var(--cy,34px));visibility:visible;transition:clip-path .8s var(--ux-ease),visibility 0s}
.u045-sheet small{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--muted)}
.u045-nav{margin:12px 0 0;padding:0;list-style:none}
.u045-ln{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;padding:10px 0;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.03em;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-2);color:inherit;text-decoration:none;opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px);transition:opacity .25s,transform .3s var(--ux-ease)}
.u045-ln span{background:linear-gradient(var(--brand),var(--brand)) no-repeat 0 100%/0 3px;padding-bottom:2px;transition:background-size .45s var(--ux-ease)}
.u045-ln:hover span,.u045-ln:focus-visible span{background-size:100% 3px}
.u045-ln:focus-visible{outline:none}
.u045-ln[aria-current="page"]{color:var(--brand)}
header.top.is-open .u045-ln{opacity:1;transform:none;transition:opacity .4s var(--ux-ease) calc(.22s + var(--i) * 60ms),transform .7s var(--ux-spring) calc(.22s + var(--i) * 60ms)}
.u045-foot{margin-top:auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;opacity:0;transform:translateY(14px);transition:opacity .25s,transform .3s}
header.top.is-open .u045-foot{opacity:1;transform:none;transition:opacity .4s .5s,transform .6s var(--ux-spring) .5s}
.u045-foot a{height:44px;padding:0 16px;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--line);transition:background-color .3s}
.u045-foot a:hover{background:var(--line-2)}
.u045-foot a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--brand);outline-offset:2px}
@media (max-width:375px){.u045-ln{font-size:24px}}

/* 푸터 3열 (열린도구 / 4축 콘텐츠 / 함께) — edzip.kr 정보 구조 차용, 회원제 도입 없이 정적 정보 + AI 에이전트 검증 */
footer{padding:32px 0 40px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);margin-top:48px}
.foot-cols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr 1fr;gap:32px;padding:20px 0 18px}
.foot-cols>section{min-width:0}
.foot-cols b{display:block;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.02em;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:8px}
.foot-cols p{margin:0;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.65}
.foot-cols ul{margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none}
.foot-cols li{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:13px}
.foot-cols li a{color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none}
.foot-cols li a:hover{color:var(--brand-ink);text-decoration:underline}
.foot-meta{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;padding:14px 0 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted)}
.foot-meta a{color:var(--ink)}
@media (max-width:768px){
  .foot-cols{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px}
}
</style>
<script is:inline>
(function () {
  var header = document.querySelector('header.top');
  if (!header) return;
  var ham = header.querySelector('.u045-ham');
  if (!ham) return;
  var sheet = header.querySelector('.u045-sheet');
  var main = document.getElementById('main');
  var focusables = sheet ? Array.prototype.slice.call(sheet.querySelectorAll('a')) : [];
  var open = false;
  
  function origin() {
    if (!sheet) return;
    var rect = ham.getBoundingClientRect();
    sheet.style.setProperty('--cx', (rect.left + rect.width / 2) + 'px');
    sheet.style.setProperty('--cy', (rect.top + rect.height / 2) + 'px');
  }
  
  function set(v) {
    open = v;
    origin();
    header.classList.toggle('is-open', v);
    ham.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(v));
    ham.setAttribute('aria-label', v ? '메뉴 닫기' : '메뉴 열기');
    if (sheet) sheet.setAttribute('aria-hidden', String(!v));
    if (main) main.inert = v;
    focusables.forEach(function (a) { a.tabIndex = v ? 0 : -1; });
    document.body.style.overflow = v ? 'hidden' : '';
  }
  
  ham.addEventListener('click', function () { set(!open); });
  
  focusables.forEach(function (a) {
    a.addEventListener('click', function () {
      set(false);
      ham.focus();
    });
  });
  
  document.addEventListener('keydown', function (e) {
    if (!open) return;
    if (e.key === 'Escape') { e.preventDefault(); set(false); ham.focus(); return; }
    if (e.key !== 'Tab') return;
    var list = [ham].concat(focusables), i = list.indexOf(document.activeElement);
    if (i < 0) return;
    e.preventDefault();
    list[(i + (e.shiftKey ? -1 : 1) + list.length) % list.length].focus();
  });
  
  set(false);
  window.addEventListener('resize', origin);
})();
</script>
</body></html>
